# Project Details > POST /api/subscriptions/{id}

Creates a new subscription document. To avoid the need for the client to store a server generated identifier, we will require the client to provide a unique subscription identifier. This will also allow the client to use meaningful identifiers e.g. 1000-2004-cohort1.

Example request body:

{ "networks": [ { "name": "assethub", "id": 1000, "relay": "polkadot", "provider": { "type": "ws", "url": "wss://asethub-rpc" } }, { "name": "parallel", "id": 2012, "relay": "polkadot", "provider": { "type": "smoldot" } } ] }

{ "subject": "xcm-hrmp-transfers", "args":{ "origin": { "network": "assethub", "senders": [ { "accountId": "5GEWco3EGfM27Z9cAmVnzFnZ6Y7vkqNVvWM4NgQZj4n84Wh6", "type": "AccountId32" } ] }, "destination": { "network": "moonbeam" }, }, "notification": {

